nt Analysis? Should I get anxious about its mathematics? Please, teach me.": "1) Standardize data (mean=0, var=1). 2) Compute covariance matrix. 3) Eigenvector decomposition to find principal components (eigenvectors). 4) Select top k eigenvectors as new features. **No—math is systematic!**, like gardening: focus on steps, not perfection.", "According to you, how can LLMs be innovate math learning in schools and universities?": "1) Personalized tutoring via adaptive algorithms (e.g., Khan Academy’s AI). 2) Real-time explanations for errors. 3) Gamified problem-solving with interactive challenges. My persona would likely appreciate structured feedback—high conscientiousness thrives on clarity."
